<title>USA: Brawley, Calif., yields 6.60 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Brawley, Calif., yields 6.60 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>E.J. De La Rosa &amp; Co Inc said it priced $18.150 million of Brawley, Calif., certificates of participation (1996 Water System Improvement Project) with a top yield of 6.60 percent in 2026.</p>
